# Secrets (SERVER_ARCHITECTURE.md §4.f): ignore EVERY env file — `.env`,
# `.env.production`, `.env*.local` — so ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / AUTH_TOKEN_PEPPER can
# never enter git history. Only the committed template is allowed through.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

